  <item>
    <title>50.从段睿看如何做一个社会企业家</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6b03e62e6f7bbb70cd599df6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6b03e62e6f7bbb70cd599df6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 07:20:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，大家好。我是Zoe。最近看了一个视频，脱不花✖️段睿的长谈，于是想从段睿的所作所为中来谈谈如何做一个社会企业家。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">00:01:26</a>乐观的性格是一切开始的基础 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">00:03:19</a>人不应该做自己位置上自我利益最大化的决策 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">00:05:37</a> 女性对于婚前财产的合理规划的重要性 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">00:07:04</a> 科研团队的构成、做什么样的事情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">00:11:11</a> 与政府主导或者资本主导科研团队合作机制的最大不同</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">00:18:42</a> 将互联网思维引入到药物研发</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1368">00:22:48</a> 段睿做直播电商主播后进行的改革</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1843">00:30:43</a> 如何应对压力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2092">00:34:52</a> 所有的系统设计都回归到了最本质   </span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66dfbfd07d47045c750778c1/lkQ0O7FQnyRqChxbiW0iHi1dP0rB.m4a" length="18891126" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjJO0Df_eX7iFewLp0zok0vAm4U0.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>50</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>49.无限游戏：看清痛苦之源</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af93cbd14d01a26f8a9ff31</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af93cbd14d01a26f8a9ff31</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 05:06:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，大家好，我是Zoe。今天跟大家分享的是西蒙斯涅克的《无限的游戏》。这本书主要是探讨了在商业世界本应该适用无限游戏思维，但是仍然有太多的商业领袖以赢为目的。他们追求的是业绩、市场占有率、第一名，从而引发大家对于管理模式进行思考。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:00:51</a> 什么是有限游戏？什么是无限游戏？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">00:05:49</a> 有限思维的公司具有什么样的特征呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">00:09:49</a> 什么是崇高的事业？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="974">00:16:14</a> 这个崇高的事业通常有什么特点？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">00:25:36</a> 登月计划≠崇高的事业</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">00:29:40</a>如何将崇高的事业进行声明？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2205">00:36:45</a>公司是谁的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2543">00:42:23</a>偏好意志还是资源？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3007">00:50:07</a>什么是彼此信任的团队呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3655">1:00:55</a> 什么是构建信任团队所需的真正领导力？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4296">1:11:36</a> 如何解决有毒文化道德滑坡？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4777">1:19:37</a> 如何看待竞争者甚至敌人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5122">1:25:22</a> 变通并不是因为能够预见未来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5313">1:28:33</a> 何为敢于领导？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5455">1:30:55</a> 如何才能获得改变思维方式的勇气呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5792">1:36:32</a> 领导者说出来的事业或者目标，必须是他们真正相信的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6006">1:40:06</a> 没有完全无限思维的领导者</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6292">1:44:52</a> 不论组织，人生何尝不是如此？</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66dfbfd07d47045c750778c1/lqR-WKMokQwvCSW967tVyVEqmg3Q.m4a" length="53573191" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:48:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiTT8v65MNaHXjZpdYm8EWiDRuOQ.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>49</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>48.读CZ的《币安人生》膜拜大佬重燃斗志</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae4b18797726cd4675a5746</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae4b18797726cd4675a5746</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:07:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，大家好，我是Zoe。每当我觉得自己没有心力的时候，就会读一本斗志昂扬的书，看看那些大佬是如何对抗生活中的磨难的。于是，这次我选择读CZ的《币安人生》来给自己充充电。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">00:01:15</a> CZ的学生时代</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">00:04:47</a> CZ早年在东京与上海创业</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">00:10:16</a> CZ开始探索比特币行业</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="716">00:11:56</a> 模拟器理论</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">00:16:18</a> 币安诞生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">00:24:04</a> CZ的财富逻辑</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1544">00:25:44</a>  与创投相关的事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1748">00:29:08</a> 缩小知识壁垒的重要性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1808">00:30:08</a> 顺利的投资往往是因缘聚合</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1969">00:32:49</a> CZ在美国服刑与被特赦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2349">00:39:09</a> CZ总结自己人生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2517">00:41:57</a> CZ的一些原则</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66dfbfd07d47045c750778c1/lvr9_bj2eX_AZWyFXTULGD4XZjKV.m4a" length="25408914" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fly02m1zo30SB6sUhp_7IaMN_1u7.jpeg"/>
    <itunes:episode>48</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
