  <item>
    <title>47.梁宁的《真需求》是一本产品书，还是一本哲学书</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6adb7218c96c8942ec11467e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6adb7218c96c8942ec11467e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:44:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，大家好，我是Zoe。刚读完梁宁的《真需求》，我不禁感慨，这究竟是一本产品书，还是一本哲学书？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">00:21:21</a> </span><strong><u><span>初识梁宁是在得到课程</span></u></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">00:03:43</a></span><strong><u><span>一个公司的价值观，必然是创始人人格的投射</span></u></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">00:10:30</a></span><strong><u><span>创业者不是无中生有创造价值</span></u></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="731">00:12:11</a></span><strong><u><span>道法自然的模式</span></u></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">00:15:43</a></span><strong><u><span>大牌真正的内核</span></u></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1099">00:18:19</a></span><strong><u><span>存在being</span></u></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">00:22:24</a></span><strong><u><span>你没有什么或许是持续回避的结果，你有的或许是最大的痛点</span></u></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">00:26:31</a></span><strong><u><span>利益与阵营</span></u></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1817">00:30:17</a></span><strong><u><span>鬼谷子“决、符、权、枢”</span></u></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1923">00:32:03</a></span><strong><u><span>归属感</span></u></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2006">00:33:26</a></span><strong><u><span>高维能力可以复用what can I do？</span></u></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2101">00:35:01</a></span><strong><u><span>为什么走上两条路，或许也源自每个人过往走过的路？</span></u></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2389">00:39:49</a></span><strong><u><span>应然与实然</span></u></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66dfbfd07d47045c750778c1/lmDnPXtM_Uuce737dJw_mGNAt-__.m4a" length="21735014" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvclPmMsB2gPmFkF8rlT9cx7yaL3.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>47</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
