  <item>
    <title>46.从《关乎天下》系列再聊创业流程</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad4e925641ef406308d8ebe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad4e925641ef406308d8ebe</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:48:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，大家好，我是Zoe。</span></p><p><span>接着上一期，我们再聊聊关明生的三本书系列《关乎天下》。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2213">00:36:53</a> 价值主张与经济模式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">00:08:12</a>蹚通商业模式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">00:13:23</a>团队与组织</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1446">00:24:06</a>规模化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2652">00:44:12</a>危机与第二曲线</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2894">00:48:14</a>创业者自身</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3141">00:52:21</a>日常要花80%的时间在防火，而不是救火。</span></p><p><span>不要因果倒置，那么结局其实在开始时就注定。</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
