  <item>
    <title>42.致初创团队的CEO们——听本霍洛维茨讲创业维艰</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b97b22f8b8079bfadfe675</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b97b22f8b8079bfadfe675</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Mar 2026 16:54:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，大家好，我是Zoe。最近读了一本书，是本霍洛维茨写的《创业维艰》。因为我也曾经在一个类似于创业团队中工作过，所以结合这本书中的内容，来看看我之前工作的创业团队都踩过哪些坑，也算是为如今AI创业浪潮中新的创业者们分享一下经验。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 自问“如果这个公司破产了之后我会怎么办？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> 时间是交易最大的敌人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> 问问自己现在还没有做什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a> 既然要赛狗，那就需要一只兔子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">06:08</a> 创业公司的CEO不应该计算成功的概率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">08:12</a> 健康的企业文化会鼓励员工公开坏消息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="548">09:08</a> 如果需要裁员不要推诿给其他人；裁员后的讲话是说给那些留下来的人听的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="705">11:45</a> 解雇高管的注意事项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">16:24</a>招聘主管：能力＞没有缺点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">17:57</a> 管理 &nbsp;人＞产品＞利润数字</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 避免负向螺旋，解决员工辞职问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1367">22:47</a> 不要从创业家朋友公司挖人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1409">23:29</a> 大公司的主管Vs.创业团队的主管；面试时问什么问题评估应聘者是否适合加入创业团队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1678">27:58</a> 如何设置经营目标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1796">29:56</a> 警惕管理债务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1902">31:42</a> 灵活处理科技公司爱说脏话的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1933">32:13</a> 选择适度野心的员工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1997">33:17</a> 处理办公室政治问题：胁迫式的加薪诉求、主管领地扩张的流言蜚语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2175">36:15</a> CEO居中调解部门投诉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2338">38:58</a> 外围选拔人才Vs.内部提拔人才</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2458">40:58</a> 如何在不熟悉的领域去制定招聘的高标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2496">41:36</a> C-level高管无法被培养</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2536">42:16</a> One on One meeting的价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2628">43:48</a> 管理人员的个人野心凌驾于基层员工的利益之上，阻碍基层员工的信息交流，是很多组织设计失败的根源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2723">45:23</a> 当下没有必要让自己被正反两种非常极端的思路所束缚；盯着路，别看墙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">47:30</a> 员工花非常大的精力去应付部门矛盾、流程缺陷＝管理不善</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2938">48:58</a> 永远不要过于相信所谓的专业人士的标签</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3275">54:35</a> 我之所以为我，是因为自己的经历；所谓的正确解法可能就是在每个创业者自己的心中</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66dfbfd07d47045c750778c1/lh6Bdt8nl9b2j2FMffmFSnu2_XGc.m4a" length="57368434" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnBGNKSawGzeZhBm_3mhSeKTgYee.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>42</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>41.羡慕阿波罗，嫉妒阿波罗，成为阿波罗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/697da0d6073030367a8ef027</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">697da0d6073030367a8ef027</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 31 Jan 2026 06:32:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，大家好，我是zoe。今天跟大家聊聊我的狗狗，阿波罗的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 养狗之前的功利心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">03:29</a> 创造爱的能力一直在我们手中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">06:05</a> 阿波罗有我羡慕的童年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">08:07</a> 阿波罗喜欢撒娇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a> 阿波罗爱管闲事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="898">14:58</a> 阿波罗敦厚善良</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a> 阿波罗懂得为自己争取权利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1283">21:23</a>阿波罗很自洽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1368">22:48</a>阿波罗会审时度势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1516">25:16</a> 阿波罗的缺点：不爱学习，一心二用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a> 阿波罗会享受小确幸，我也要学习它懂得享受的心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">34:12</a> 在选择无限的时代，过早做终身的职业决定反而是一个错误</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">38:10</a> 秘书问题理论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2469">41:09</a> 在定居城市、终身职业、伴侣这三个重大决定上要谨慎思考，等待期可以先做个快乐的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>小时候的阿波罗</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fifrjj63ihC74kMJRIo0ZZyO-WbE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>1岁的阿波罗</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvDQ_E6Q6s_iZS3MhA7C2mqwcXbd.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66dfbfd07d47045c750778c1/lkd1f5iUFm03XFBPqgn_xlEeltl-.m4a" length="48172162" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FljgAQinMHImOVS0LJWyV36jNO3W.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>41</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>40.从大冰直播切片引发的思考——放手负面思考，你可以选择快乐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69774d45ef1cf272a790b878</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69774d45ef1cf272a790b878</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Jan 2026 11:21:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，大家好，我是Zoe。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> &nbsp;回顾大冰连线第一个女孩的故事：早年坎坷，因正骨瘫痪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a> &nbsp;回顾大冰连线第二个女孩的故事：哈佛读书，竞争激烈，求职不顺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> 我不理解</span><strong><span>两个同样积极努力的女孩，智商差别也不大，为什么命运差异如此之大？</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="905">15:05</a> 两人人生的容错率不同&nbsp;</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> 承认命运不公的现实</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">19:39</a> 痛苦的不可比较性与性质不同</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> 命运根本不在乎个体，因果错位才是真相</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">24:04</a> 大冰因材施教，认知能力高超</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1634">27:14</a> 结合自身经历，为什么如此共鸣两个女孩的痛苦，因为我身上重叠了这两种痛苦 ：“本可以”的折磨；对照组的冲击；掌控感的失序</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">32:12</a> 大冰智慧的“拿来主义”：接受强制重启；警惕幸存者偏差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2254">37:34</a> 负面情绪是可以避免的，而且没有必要的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2394">39:54</a> 所有的事情都是先在你心里变成了问题，才成为问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2512">41:52</a> 人生自有其轨迹，该如何就如何，大部分其实取决于你怎么看待。人生来到世间，经历各种感官体验，然后离开，如何理解这些体验完全由你自己决定，不同的人有不同的理解方式。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2716">45:16</a> 智慧是无法传递的，你只能在自己的人生经历中重新发现。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2783">46:23</a> 思考过往的痛苦是为了摆脱，不是为了沉湎于此。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66dfbfd07d47045c750778c1/lpyMj6AajJOrFmVD2_yharP4RA3f.m4a" length="50201785" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:12</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi2-WBnB5YBj23NCYbDXeI3jankj.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>40</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>39.日本Pokka 2005年的困境</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69576fc514db1df9ef02165b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69576fc514db1df9ef02165b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 Jan 2026 07:15:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，大家好，新年快乐！我准备更新一个新的专题，分享一些著名商业案例在历史上的抉择。今天要讲的这家企业叫Pokka，一家日本饮料公司。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> Pokka的历史背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a> Pokka的2001年改革</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a> Pokka的资本政策问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 为什么MBO收购是脱离困境的方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="837">13:57</a> AP对于Pokka的分析评价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> 从AP角度看应该投资吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1679">27:59</a>从Pokka的角度来说应该接受AP投资吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">32:15</a> 什么是企业价值</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjZKU6Hzu1AkTHZghVSOj3J2CHy5.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2555">42:35</a> AP预计能赚多少钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2733">45:33</a> 为了重新上市Pokka做了什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3404">56:44</a> Pokka最终的结果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3533">58:53</a> AP到底赚了多少</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66dfbfd07d47045c750778c1/luui9naPysrHqqwvmU7z231bxtOK.m4a" length="60743457" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhqlhy60ZLKlNx66mH1ooBpesUE1.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>39</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
