  <item>
    <title>38.《周易有答案》里的 64 条人生补丁</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6943f65f038062bdbca0283b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6943f65f038062bdbca0283b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Dec 2025 12:57:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，大家好，我是Zoe。最近读了一本梁东的《周易有答案》，这一期我想将其中有共鸣的部分与大家分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a> 序言：何为世界的真相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 序言：何为占卜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a> 序言：非线性的世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="533">08:53</a> 乾卦：君子终日乾乾，夕惕。若厉，无咎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="689">11:29</a> 巽卦：小亨(口误，应读作</span><strong><span>hēng</span></strong><span>)。利有攸往，利见大人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="814">13:34</a> 升卦：积极心理学的力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a> 讼卦：化诉讼的讼为歌颂的颂，把争论变成颂扬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a> 困卦：我内心的志向，才是在无可奈何的境况中唯一的一束心灯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">20:33</a> 解卦：君子维，有解，吉。有孚于小人(小人：被“贪嗔痴慢疑”</span></p><span></span><p><span>束缚住心智的人)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1361">22:41</a> 蒙卦：初筮</span><strong><span>shì</span></strong><span>告，再三渎，渎则不告。利贞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1456">24:16</a> 蹇卦：往蹇，来反</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1537">25:37</a> 否卦：休否，大人吉。其亡，其亡，系于苞桑；倾否，先否后喜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1732">28:52</a> 萃卦：萃有位，无咎。匪孚。元，永贞，悔亡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1861">31:01</a> 晋卦：悔亡，失得，勿恤(口误，应读作</span><strong><span>xù</span></strong><span>)。往，吉，无不利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a> 比卦：比之匪人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2058">34:18</a> 益卦：益之，用凶事，无咎。有孚，中行。告公，用圭；莫益之，或击之。立心勿恒，凶。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2414">40:14</a> 震卦：没有方向的动可能也是另外一种智慧；洊</span><strong><span>jiàn</span></strong><span>雷，震；君子以恐惧修省</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2730">45:30</a> 噬嗑shì hé卦：享。利用狱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2829">47:09</a> 无妄卦：天下雷行，物与无妄。先王以茂对时育万物；不耕获，不菑zī畬yú，则利有攸往；无妄之灾，或系之牛。行人之得，邑人之灾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3185">53:05</a> 贲（bì）卦：白贲，无咎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3328">55:28</a> 离卦：履错然。敬之，无咎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3416">56:56</a> 节卦：不节若，则嗟若。无咎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3677">1:01:17</a> 中孚卦：不要忘记了忙碌困顿中间总是有些所谓的空隙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3738">1:02:18</a> 归妹卦：错配几乎是人生的一个常态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3784">1:03:04</a> 履卦：用心若镜，即“斋其心”；眇miǎo能视，跛bǒ能履，履虎尾，咥dié人，凶。武人为于大君。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4102">1:08:22</a> 泰卦：翩翩不富，以其邻。不戒，以孚；城复于隍，勿用师，自邑</span><strong><span>yì</span></strong><span>告命，贞吝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4319">1:11:59</a> 需卦：给予者在give的时候也是满足自身的需要，接受者在gain的时候也满足了自身的需要。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4400">1:13:20</a> 小畜卦：像植物一样的思考方式和斗争策略，通过时间来换取空间；有孚，血去，惕出，无咎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4490">1:14:50</a> 大壮卦：雷在天上，大壮。君子以非礼弗履；小人用壮，君子用罔；贞厉，羝dī羊触藩，羸léi其角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4849">1:20:49</a> 后记：谦卦的六五爻，“不富，以其邻。利用侵伐，无不利”。这个“坏邻居”是谁呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66dfbfd07d47045c750778c1/ljQX_wbVKtF6iOjBsGCCMViH6zFR.m4a" length="81773287" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:23:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgYXDkjmPLgWoZEo50TwWCTYl-wD.png"/>
