  <item>
    <title>36.中元节聊聊死亡以及科研英雄的传说带给我们生活下去的勇气</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68bc3fcf97178f08ee980ae9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68bc3fcf97178f08ee980ae9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Sep 2025 14:13:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi，大家好。我是Zoe。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> 分享《当呼吸化为空气》中对于死亡的描写</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a> 中元节如何描述我内心中的死亡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="417">06:57</a> 我与作者都有那么一个瞬间感到冥冥之中被安排了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="499">08:19</a> 现实中感受统计学概念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a> 科学仍然不足以描述死亡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a> 通过王立铭的《吃货的修养：脂肪、糖和代谢病的科学传奇》这本书了解到脂肪的功能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1039">17:19</a> 瘦素抵抗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1145">19:05</a> 小分子制药流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1301">21:41</a> 双面胆固醇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1464">24:24</a> 立普妥的商业奇迹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1826">30:26</a> 人工重建器官的相似逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66dfbfd07d47045c750778c1/lqcAxUcLg3mCynWpnQa0HqK0G94X.m4a" length="35891359" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:17</itunes:duration>
